         <change when="2026-04-07T12:52:45-04:00" who="http://papyri.info/editor/users/joshuad.sosin">Submit - Reg in line 17 is confusing as entered: &lt;:ποιούμεν&lt;ον&gt;|reg|ποιουμεν:&gt;, as if papyrus has ποιουμεν. Papyrus has ποιουμενα, clear from digital image and P.Wisc. I 32 (where eds print "ποιουμένα" l. "ποιοuμένην". Reg should read: &lt;:ποιούμενον|reg|ποιούμενα:&gt;.</change>
